{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2023-06/1065225/block/singleImage/3275314/df/WhatsApp%20Image%202023-06-01%20at%2018.18.46%20(2).jpeg?updatedAt=1795419859\"/><figcaption>一名70歲女子倒臥於屯門和田邨和彩樓單位內，胸口及手部受傷昏迷，當場死亡</figcaption></figure><p>今日(23日)早上11時25分，警方接獲報案，指其一名女性朋友倒臥於屯門和田邨和彩樓單位內，胸口及手部受傷昏迷，身旁有一把染血約25厘米的牛肉刀。救護員接報到場經檢驗證實女子已明顯死亡，人員圍封單位調查，在屋內檢獲遺書，70歲姓王事主死因有待驗屍後確定，案件列作屍體發現。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:54:08.618418+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T07:44:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T01:17:05.991857+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T08:47:28.658131+00:00","content_hash":"94e9600d808123af19063b8e07f78992e4b8135a36cb5c1f00b9b224c448c459","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:54:08.618418+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}